{"summary": "黏合格，兩步：沒 plan.json 先叫 tools/director 出 beat 表、tools/plan_lint 校驗（最多 2 次）；再叫 tools/writer 照表寫一稿（第 2 稿起附 check 的打回理由），收成 draft.json；稿已定就什麼都不做",
 "time_ms": {"val": 16000, "max": 600000},
 "resource": ["llm", "cpu"],
 "llm_calls": {"val": 2, "max": 5},
 "llm_tokens": {"val": 4300, "max": 15000},
 "llm_endpoint": "http://localhost:4000/v1",
 "llm_model": "chatgpt-gpt-6-luna-low",
 "side_effect": true,
 "idempotent": false,
 "deterministic": false,
 "interrupt": "resumable",
 "parallel": false,
 "reads": ["$AOS_STACK/brief.json", "$AOS_STACK/check.json", "$AOS_STACK/plan.json"],
 "writes": ["$AOS_STACK/draft.json", "$AOS_STACK/plan.json", "$AOS_STACK/director/（director 的小格與工作區 ws/）", "$AOS_STACK/plan_lint/（空小格）", "$AOS_STACK/writer/（writer 的小格與工作區 ws/）"],
 "grow_level": 4,
 "calls": ["tools/director（單發腦函數，grow_level 4：_entry 單子＋ask.py；小格 $AOS_STACK/director/；沒 plan.json 時才叫，一題最多 2 次，第 2 次同小格續聊）", "tools/plan_lint（純函數，真資料夾；round3 從 lib/ 搬回）", "tools/writer（agent，小格 $AOS_STACK/writer/，工作區 $AOS_STACK/writer/ws/）"],
 "note": "llm_* 是外層作者自報＝這一格跑一次的 director＋writer（M6 外層贏）：第 1 稿 director 1～2＋writer 1～3，第 2、3 稿只有 writer；這一格自己不問腦"}
